1
00:00:00,278 --> 00:00:04,618
(Raj:)That sounds amazing.
First movie I'm watching, Annie.

2
00:00:06,493 --> 00:00:08,913
(Howard:)How exactly
would these glasses work?

3
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:11,960
(Jimmy:)How the hell should I know?
That's why I need a nerd.

4
00:00:13,083 --> 00:00:15,673
(Leonard:)I don't think something
Iike that's even possible.

5
00:00:15,877 --> 00:00:19,007
Aw, come on. You could figure it out.
You're, like, the smartest guy.

6
00:00:19,214 --> 00:00:21,924
(Sheldon:)The smartest?... All right.

7
00:00:22,133 --> 00:00:27,093
(Sheldon:)I may not have a firm grasp on sarcasm,
but, uh, even I know that was a doozy.

8
00:00:28,682 --> 00:00:31,102
(Sheldon:)You can't live
in fear of this man forever.

9
00:00:31,309 --> 00:00:34,189
- Sheldon, I got this.
- You clearly don't.

10
00:00:34,396 --> 00:00:36,856
(Sheldon:)What my spineless friend
Iacks the courage to say...

11
00:00:37,065 --> 00:00:40,775
(Sheldon:)...is you're a terrible person
who took advantage of his tiny size...

12
00:00:40,986 --> 00:00:45,076
(Sheldon:)...his uncoordinated nature,
and his congenital lack of masculinity.

13
00:00:45,282 --> 00:00:47,572
(Penny(entering):)- Sheldon.
- Leonard, I platonically love you, man.

14
00:00:47,784 --> 00:00:49,364
(Sheldon:)But face it, you're a mess.

15
00:00:53,039 --> 00:00:54,249
(Jimmy:)I don't understand.

16
00:00:54,958 --> 00:00:57,208
(Leonard:)I think what he's trying to say
is that maybe...

17
00:00:57,419 --> 00:01:07,029
(Leonard:)...in high school,
you picked on me a little bit.

